  "name": "vyges-axi-dram-xbar",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "description": "Vyges data-plane AXI consolidation: heterogeneous-width AXI4 masters -> ONE AXI4 link to the DRAM controller (litedram). Two width CLASSES: NumWide masters @ WideDataWidth (e.g. 256b CoralNPU island ddr) + NumNarrow masters @ NarrowDataWidth (e.g. 64b CPU mem); each is width-adapted INSIDE the wrapper by a pulp axi_dw_converter to XbarDataWidth, then a pulp axi_xbar (N->1) arbitrates them onto one DRAM AXI4 master. Width adaptation lives in this one verified IP so the SoC generator connects masters at their NATIVE width. Flat AXI boundary so the generator wires it from interfaces[].signals[]. Built on the onboarded pulp-platform/axi + common_cells (Solderpad).",
  "license": "SHL-0.51",
  "template": "vyges-ip-template@1.0.0",
